ache/airflow/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/deployments","created_at":"2015-04-13T18:04:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:15Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:07Z","git_url":"git://github.com/apache/airflow.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:apache/airflow.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow","homepage":"https://airflow.apache.org/","size":790917,"stargazers_count":47308,"watchers_count":47308,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":18214,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/73119","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73119","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73119.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/73119.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The `DELETE` queued events endpoints only cleared queued events of non-partitioned assets (`AssetDagRunQueue`). A queued partitioned event (`AssetPartitionDagRun` + `PartitionedAssetKeyLog`) that turned out to be wrong or no longer relevant could not be removed, so it would still trigger the downstream Dag run.\r\n\r\nThis adds an optional `partition_key` query parameter to:\r\n\r\n- `DELETE /api/v2/assets/{asset_id}/queuedEvents`\r\n- `DELETE /api/v2/dags/{dag_id}/assets/queuedEvents`\r\n- `DELETE /api/v2/dags/{dag_id}/assets/{asset_id}/queuedEvents`\r\n\r\nBehaviour when `partition_key` is given:\r\n\r\n- `partition_key` matches the partition key of the queued asset event (`PartitionedAssetKeyLog.source_partition_key`), the same key used by `POST /assets/{asset_id}/materialize`. It is not the partition key of the Dag run the event would create, which can differ when the Dag uses a partition mapper. For example, with hourly upstream partitions rolled up into a daily Dag run, `partition_key=2026-09-02T05` clears only that hour and the daily partition keeps waiting for it to be re-emitted.\r\n- Only events of pending partitions (`created_dag_run_id IS NULL`) are deleted; partitions that already created a Dag run are kept.\r\n- Queued events of non-partitioned assets (`AssetDagRunQueue`) are not deleted.\r\n- The `asset_id`, `dag_id`, `before`, and readable-Dag filters narrow which events are deleted. A pending `AssetPartitionDagRun` is deleted only when all of its contributing events are deleted, so clearing some events of a partition keeps it waiting for them instead of dropping the progress made by the others. An empty pending partition would otherwise sit at the head of the scheduler's FIFO queue forever.\r\n- Returns 404 when nothing was deleted, as before.\r\n\r\nWithout `partition_key` the endpoints behave exactly as before.\r\n\r\ncloses: #70444\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\r\n\r\n- [X] Yes — Claude Opus 5","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73119/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73119/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/6035223165","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/70444#issuecomment-6035223165","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70444","id":6035223165,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABZ7oyfQ","user":{"login":"CM000n","id":7945681,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDU2ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7945681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n","html_url":"https://github.com/CM000n","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T09:37:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T09:37:47Z","body":"We hit the same gap on Airflow 3.3.1 after reprocessing upstream assets: partitions that only received part of their required events (e.g. 1/13 or 13/117) stay `pending` forever and the DAG list shows \"N pending Dag runs\" in the schedule column, which is misleading. `delete-dag-queued-events` / `DELETE /dags/{dag_id}/assets/queuedEvents` returns nothing to delete since `AssetDagRunQueue` is empty; the pending partitions are only visible via the internal `/ui/partitioned_dag_runs` endpoint and can't be cleared via the public API or `airflowctl`. +1 for the proposed `partition_key` support (ideally also a \"delete all pending partitions for this Dag\" option).\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/6035223165/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"CM000n","id":7945681,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDU2ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7945681?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n","html_url":"https://github.com/CM000n","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CM000n/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]]
